# Docker build context (context = repo root).
# Keep the context small and keep out stale artifacts that would break
# incremental builds (e.g. tsconfig.tsbuildinfo) or leak secrets.

# Dependencies and build artifacts
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/out
**/build
**/coverage

# TypeScript incremental cache: if a stale one gets in, tsc does not re-emit dist.
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets / environments (never in the build context)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# VCS, local notes and temporary files
.git
_local
.claude
**/*.log
.DS_Store
